  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the arrangement shown in figure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> are the accelerations of masses <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> respectively. Which of the following relation is true for this arrangement?</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/02901a11-64c2-4bc3-899e-c47fdc0bab88-image.png\" style=\"width: 120px; height: 242px;\" /></p>",
