  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The figure shows the tension acting on each string in the system.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f7da3da6-9f53-409f-bc9d-ebd55b2e4fd0-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 297px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8721;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
